#. module: ssi_school_fee_waiver
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_fee_waiver.field_school_fee_waiver_schedule__amount_realized
msgid ""
"Amount actually waived for this schedule line. Filled by the deduction "
"document, a later module out of this item's scope; always zero until then."
msgstr "Jumlah yang benar-benar diberi keringanan untuk baris jadwal ini. Diisi oleh dokumen potongan, modul lanjutan di luar lingkup item ini; selalu nol sampai saat itu."

#. module: ssi_school_fee_waiver
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_fee_waiver.field_school_fee_waiver_schedule__amount_planned
msgid ""
"Amount this schedule line plans to waive: the Line's Percentage of Base "
"Amount, its Fixed Amount, or the full Base Amount, capped at the Line's Max "
"Amount when that ceiling is above zero, and never above Base Amount."
msgstr "Jumlah yang direncanakan baris jadwal ini untuk diberi keringanan: Persentase Baris dari Jumlah Dasar, Jumlah Tetapnya, atau seluruh Jumlah Dasar, dibatasi pada Jumlah Maksimum Baris bila batas itu di atas nol, dan tidak pernah melebihi Jumlah Dasar."

