#. module: ssi_school_fee_waiver
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_fee_waiver.field_school_fee_waiver_schedule__base_amount
msgid ""
"Billing amount this schedule line's Computation is applied to: the sum of "
"the linked payment term's detail lines matching the Line's Product, or its "
"Product Category when the Line targets one. Detail lines marked Voided are "
"always excluded. Zero when no payment term is linked."
msgstr "Jumlah penagihan yang menjadi sasaran Perhitungan baris jadwal ini: total baris detail termin pembayaran tertaut yang cocok dengan Produk pada Baris, atau Kategori Produknya bila Baris menyasar kategori. Baris detail yang ditandai Dialihkan selalu dikecualikan. Nol bila tidak ada termin pembayaran yang tertaut."

#. module: ssi_school_fee_waiver
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_fee_waiver.field_school_fee_waiver__line_ids
msgid ""
"Billing components covered by this waiver, and how much of each is waived. "
"At least one line is expected before this waiver is confirmed."
msgstr "Komponen penagihan yang dicakup keringanan ini, dan berapa banyak yang diberi keringanan dari masing-masing. Setidaknya satu baris diharapkan ada sebelum keringanan ini dikonfirmasi."

#. module: ssi_school_fee_waiver
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_fee_waiver.field_school_fee_waiver__source_type
msgid ""
"Billing source this waiver is billed against. This module only registers "
"Enrollment -- extension modules add further values with ``selection_add`` "
"and override the ``_get_source_*`` hooks to match."
msgstr "Sumber penagihan yang menjadi dasar penagihan keringanan ini. Modul ini hanya mendaftarkan Pendaftaran -- modul ekstensi menambahkan nilai lain dengan ``selection_add`` dan menimpa hook ``_get_source_*`` agar sesuai."

