#. module: ssi_school_fee_waiver
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_fee_waiver.field_school_enrollment__amount_fee_waiver
msgid ""
"Effective fee waiver of this enrollment: Fee Waiver Deducted plus Fee Waiver"
" Not Yet Deducted. The unrealized remainder of a partially deducted schedule"
" is not counted, because it is billed to the student, so this amount can be "
"lower than the sum of Fee Waiver Amount of the payment terms."
msgstr "Keringanan biaya efektif dari pendaftaran ini: Keringanan Biaya Terpotong ditambah Keringanan Biaya Belum Terpotong. Sisa jadwal yang terpotong sebagian dan belum terealisasi tidak dihitung, karena ditagihkan kepada siswa, sehingga jumlah ini bisa lebih rendah daripada total Jumlah Keringanan Biaya pada termin pembayaran."

